# @name loginGestionnairePna
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mamadou.diallo@sante.gouv.sn",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 0c. Login — PHARMACIEN_PNA (analyse/attribution des offres)
